data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"request-002","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've retrieved the complete return policy information for premium customers. Here's the summary:\n\n**Premium customers enjoy an extended 60-day return window** (compared to 30 days for standard customers). You automatically qualify for Premium status when you spend $500+ or place 20+ orders in a calendar year.\n\nThe return process is straightforward—just log into your account, select the item, choose your return reason, print the prepaid label, and drop it off. Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days.\n\nBeyond the extended return window, Premium customers also receive:\n- Free expedited shipping\n- 3-year warranty on electronics\n- Priority customer support (4-hour response time)\n- Early access to sales and new products\n- Dedicated account manager for orders over $500\n\nIs there anything else you'd like to know about the Premium return policy or any other NovaMart policies?\n"}],"structuredContent":{"result":"Perfect! I've retrieved the complete return policy information for premium customers. Here's the summary:\n\n**Premium customers enjoy an extended 60-day return window** (compared to 30 days for standard customers). You automatically qualify for Premium status when you spend $500+ or place 20+ orders in a calendar year.\n\nThe return process is straightforward—just log into your account, select the item, choose your return reason, print the prepaid label, and drop it off. Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days.\n\nBeyond the extended return window, Premium customers also receive:\n- Free expedited shipping\n- 3-year warranty on electronics\n- Priority customer support (4-hour response time)\n- Early access to sales and new products\n- Dedicated account manager for orders over $500\n\nIs there anything else you'd like to know about the Premium return policy or any other NovaMart policies?\n"},"isError":false}}

